{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Serious Image Problem"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Lunch Meeting"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Explain customs and appropriate behaviour at work and in different countries, using a wider range of expressions and formulas."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Responses with So and Neither"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use so and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span> for positive and <span class=\"italic\">negative</span> agreement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">So</span> is used to show agreement with positive statements. <br />Sometimes we also use too to express the same thing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br /><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I like this dress!</span><br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span><span class=\"italic\">So do I/I do too."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br /><br /><span class=\"italic\">Neither</span> is used to show agreement with negative statements. <br />Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">either</span> to express the same thing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example</span>: <br /><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I don't think this fits well.</span> <br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Neither do I. (neither is a negative word)            <br /><span class=\"italic\">I don't either.</span> (either is used with the negative)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use so and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span>, the auxiliary needs to agree with the verb tense in the original statement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br />A more colloquial form of agreement is <span class=\"italic\">\u201cme too\u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cme neither\u201d.</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":12,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Positive Agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I need a pair of jeans.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">So do I.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I was inspired by a classy red dress.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">So am I.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd like something with a boot cut.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">So would I!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've been dying to get to the mall.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Me too!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Negative Agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I don't look good in red.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Neither do I.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I haven't gone shopping in a while.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Me neither!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I haven't had a cocktail in ages.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I haven't either.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Making Suggestions</span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use modals <span class=\"italic\">could, should, might</span> and phrases to make suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use modals <span class=\"italic\">could, should, ought to, had better</span> and <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to make suggestions and recommendations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You also use phrases like:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "How about + gerund/noun <br />What about + gerund/noun <br />You might be better off with + noun <br />Why don't you/we + base form verb <br />Have you thought about + gerund/noun ... <br />It's probably worth + gerund ..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Using the phrases above make your suggestion less direct. <br />They are more common in a formal conversation."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Why don't we try it?</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">You might be better off with a low waist. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">How about this stonewashed pair?</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Have you thought about buying a dress for the wedding you're attending?</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">It's probably worth checking it out.</span> "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to take your mind off something"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to allow you to stop worrying about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Shopping helps you take your mind off things."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about clothing and styles."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "low waist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the \u200bpart of a \u200bpiece of \u200bclothing that goes around or \u200bcovers the \u200barea between the \u200bhips and the \u200bribs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You might be better off with a low waist."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to suit someone "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to look good on someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They really suit you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flattering"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "making someone \u200blook or \u200bseem \u200bbetter or more \u200battractive than \u200busual"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I find A-line dresses flattering."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "classy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "stylish or fashionable"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was inspired by a classy red dress I saw at the show. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pricey"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "expensive"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is it pricey?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob10aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cautious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "careful"}, {"type": "part_speec