age": "engenn8le04ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "27000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I'm not sure. How about this stonewashed pair?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: They really suit you. I love them!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: So do I. Have you thought about buying a dress for the wedding you're attending?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Not really. I find A-line dresses flattering, but I was inspired by a classy red dress I saw at the show.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Oh, so was I! It's probably worth checking it out. I'm sorry I don't look good in red! <br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Neither do I, but the style was just right. Maybe we should keep looking.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn8le04ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "59000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Absolutely. There's a nice boutique around the corner. I think we should consider paying it a visit.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Is it pricey? I'm cautious about spending too much on a dress I won't be wearing often.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: So am I. It might be worth checking. When's the wedding?\n<br />Janet</span>: In a month. There's no rush. How about going for drinks after we have a quick look? I need to unwind. I haven't had a cocktail in ages.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Good idea! I haven't either!", "id": 2, "image": "engenn8le04ob10re2img07.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn8le04ob10re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [{"type": "template_override", "content": 1}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}